* RBBS/RBBS41 - PRIVATE BOARD BACKENDS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* RBBS/RBBS41 - PRIVATE BOARD BACKENDS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:RBBS
    A15:RBBS41

SYSUTLS:RBBS is the private launcher that selects A15: and runs RBBS41.
RBBS41 is a retained compatibility filename; the current board identifies
itself by its own version banner.

Callers use the public A0:RBBS launcher, which establishes the intended
service context. Do not bypass that launcher for caller sessions or expose
A15:. Back up I15: before database maintenance; see HELP RBUTIL41.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
